/Users/dc/code/math/jc2/xmodel/nori-bc-verification-grok46-20260831.md-62-**SYN-A (strict interior).** Irreducible nodal plane quartic, three nodes: `C^2=16`, `r_1=3`, `T=T_x=0`. Right-hand side `6`. `16>6`. `B=16-6=10>0`. Nori 3.27 applies verbatim. (Existence classical: generic rational quartic.)
