/Users/dc/code/math/jc2/xmodel/nori-bc-verification-grok46-20260831.md:64:**SYN-B (equality, self-tangential).** Irreducible plane sextic with three `A_5` points and no other singularities: `C^2=36`, `r_1=0`, `T=9`, `T_x=0`. RHS `36`. Strict inequality `36>36` **fails** (equality). `B=36-18=18`, and `2T+T_x=18`, so `B>2T` also fails at equality. Geometric genus `(5)(4)/2-9=1`; not the extremal rational object of §7. Existence of this configuration is not used.
