/Users/dc/code/math/jc2/xmodel/nori-bc-verification-grok46-20260831.md:66:**SYN-C (fails on `T_x`).** Two smooth plane quartics whose 16 intersection units are four contacts of order 4 (`A_7` cross-points): for either component, `C^2=16`, `r_1=T=0`, `T_x=16`. Then `16>16` fails, `B=16`, `2T+T_x=16`. Same numerical shape as the bitangent conics of §3, scaled: the coefficient `1` on `T_x` is again tight. (Existence not claimed; Bézout is saturated.)
