/Users/dc/code/math/jc2/xmodel/nori-bc-verification-grok46-20260831.md-89-**Independent computation of π₁.** Charged §4.3 gives a Zariski–van Kampen computation yielding `⟨ t_1, t_λ | (t_1 t_λ)^2 = 1 ⟩`. Independently:
