/Users/dc/code/math/jc2/xmodel/nori-bc-verification-grok46-20260831.md-172-Lemma 1.3: `β_1>6` and `β_1` odd (so `e_1=1`, one pair, germ `(2,β_1)`). Then `δ_infty=(β_1-1)/2`, `δ_aff=(21-β_1)/2`, `M_emb=2+β_1-1=β_1+1=M_infty`. Naive genus `δ_aff≥1` allows `β_1∈{7,9,11,13,15,17,19}`.
